Modifications on branch nucleic-acids
-------------------------------------
Evaluation of DNA/RNA pKa and protonation support, by noshou (git user of this
repository). Every added parameter value is recorded with its source in
SOURCES.md. Modified files carry a note naming this branch and its author next to
the original header.
